"steam-4321120","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T01:10:52Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4321120,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4321120-1846651706696080","game_id":"steam-4321120","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #1 - No-AI Generated Content","summary":"First of all thank you so much for your wishlists, they are so precious for me. It means a lot for the productivity for an indie solo-dev. I'm Dogan Demir from Istanbul. I'm a software engineer for about 25 years. I'm also producing digital artworks based on creative coding.For those interested in my game The Curator, I wanted to put together a short devlog about the production phase.All the artworks, icons, visitors, and every other asset in the game were created by me using Blender. None of th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T17:07:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696080","verified_at":"2026-10-21T04:41:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4321120-1842212951295318","game_id":"steam-4321120","kind":"announcement","title":"A New Map & A New World","summary":"I want to share the new implementations about The Curator. I've been deep in for a while with a procedural map design that will make your decisions more important. I realized the game's core gameplay was too linear, and I spent a long time working on numerous concept designs to address this. Ultimately, 16 months ago, I decided to implement the branching map mechanic that was included in my first game design document..The gallery's journey is no longer a single straight line. Built a totally new","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T23:45:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951295318","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4321120-1839676055881225","game_id":"steam-4321120","kind":"update","title":"Gameplay Trailer Update (0.0.30)","summary":"First of all, a huge thank you to everyone for all your amazing support and wishlists!0.0.30 Gameplay trailer updated and published.And also new mechanics and contents:60+ City EventsUpdated Visitor UtilitiesVisitor Accesories2 New Visitor TypesNew Music and Sound Effects (Recorded by me with my precious MS-20 Mini synt. I'm still learning btw ^^)Settings Menu0.0.30 Demo will be published soon","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-29T00:38:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055881225","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4321120-1835236783559861","game_id":"steam-4321120","kind":"announcement","title":"Alpha Demo Released","summary":"I've been developing The Curator as a solo for about 13 months and after a highly active development period the very first playable alpha demo is finally ready. The concept and prototyping phases took almost 4 months. After many concept and mechanical prototyping stages, I finally decided on the path I wanted to follow, and The Curator, a roguelite about art gallery management, took its current form.You can search and find the early alpha demo on itch that represents the core concept and game lo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-11T10:03:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783559861","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4321120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T19:30:31Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T19:30:30Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4321120":"2026-10-25T19:30:31Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4321120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T19:30:30Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T19:30:30Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5357610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T19:30:31Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T19:30:31Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}}}
